Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["InfraPastLightCone", "ObjectName",
 CellID->1224892054,ExpressionUUID->"8393d601-4014-44ba-afc9-60862df940ec"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"0b1ceef1-e066-4800-bebc-060b80e35c81"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["InfraPastLightCone"]], 
     "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraCausality/ref/InfraPastLightCone", 
     "WolframInstitute/InfraCausality Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   StyleBox["v", "TI"], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "07112a4b-27f1-4049-aa48-4671f3ae4a03"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "is the past light cone of the event ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ": the events whose causal diamond with ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " is a chain, carried by the incoming light rays of ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ".",
 "\n"
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"a94da16f-50fd-492b-8802-bedf5a6a6799"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Definition: the past light cone of an event ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " is ",
 StyleBox["E", "TI"],
 "\:207b(",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ") = {",
 StyleBox["e", "TI"],
 " \[PrecedesSlantEqual] ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " : [",
 StyleBox["e", "TI"],
 ", ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 "] is a chain}, the events of the causal past that reach ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 " along a single route. Its members, the incoming light rays of ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ", are the maximal chains of ",
 StyleBox["E", "TI"],
 "\:207b(",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ") that end at ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ", listed in causal order."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"7f32ae5b-9742-4a33-9a3f-dd7d194d34a5"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The past light cone is the time reverse of the future light cone: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraPastLightCone"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraCausality/ref/InfraPastLightCone", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraCausality Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "4787a6cc-c62f-465b-b803-212a123af583"],
 " on a graph is ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraFutureLightCone"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraCausality/ref/InfraFutureLightCone", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraCausality Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "3ea36921-4e15-406a-b8ac-d69e2c49acea"],
 " on the graph with every edge reversed, with each ray read backwards. It \
holds the events that can send a light signal to ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 "; on the diamond lattice these are the two null lines below ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 "."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"a50f4ecf-a9da-4b4e-9d22-3ed365fd2797"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The head holds its event and computes nothing. Its graph, ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{"InfraMeasurement", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    StyleBox["g", "TI"], ",", " ", 
    StyleBox["c", "TI"], ",", " ", "\"\<Graph\>\""}], "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f26f027a-27d4-45a8-b0a1-cd4986573c9f"],
 ", is the Hasse diagram restricted to ",
 StyleBox["E", "TI"],
 "\:207b(",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 "), with the edge directions of the graph: a tree whose edges all lead into ",
 StyleBox["v", "TI"],
 ". Its leaf-to-root paths are the incoming light rays."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"80926f02-7c12-4a5a-9965-06931767ec21"],

