Cell["\<\
Both light cones of one event of the cylinder lattice. The future cone wraps \
around the cylinder; the past cone stops at the bottom row.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"ec77e965-b28d-4526-b3db-425be8c08edb"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"With", "[", "\n", "  ", 
